<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Tom Ron — engineering leader working in AI, currently Head of AI Solutions at Goodnotes."
  path="/about/"
>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      I’m Tom Ron, an engineering leader working in AI. I’m currently Head of AI
      Solutions at <a href="https://www.goodnotes.com/">Goodnotes</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that I was CTO at Beteende and Head of Engineering at Lynx.MD,
      where I built and led engineering teams, took products from MVP to
      production, and owned architecture, cloud cost, security and compliance
      (SOC 2, HIPAA), and delivery. Earlier I spent several years as a senior
      data scientist across healthtech and consumer companies in Berlin, and
      started out as an algorithm engineer working on NLP and large-scale data.
      I’ve also taught discrete mathematics as a teaching assistant at the
      Technion.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started in data science and still think like a data scientist — measure
      first, be honest about uncertainty, and keep visualizations clear. These
      days I write mostly about what engineering leadership looks like in the AI
      era: coding agents, spec-driven development, token economics and FinOps,
      RAG, and how teams and review workflows adapt when implementation gets
      cheap.
    </p>
    <p>
      I write here and on <a href="https://medium.com/@rontom">Medium</a>, share
      code on <a href="https://github.com/tomron">GitHub</a>, and post on <a
        href="https://x.com/tomron696">X</a
      >. The best way to reach me is on <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rontom/">LinkedIn</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-body {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .about-body p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
</style>
